# Files that tools write and rewrite themselves. Reformatting them makes each
# tool and prettier undo each other's changes, so prettier leaves them alone:
# - CLAUDE.md (any depth): AUTO-MANAGED sections and agent-written edits
# - .serena/: Serena's project config and memories
# - .claude/auto-memory/: auto-memory's state, if the plugin is re-enabled here
# - docs/superpowers/: implementation plans written and checked off by agents
# - .superpowers/: plan-execution scratch (git-ignored by its own nested
#   .gitignore, which prettier doesn't read)
CLAUDE.md
.serena/
.claude/auto-memory/
docs/superpowers/
.superpowers/
private/
